Optional installation, consulting, custom development, third-party hosting,
and third-party AI/API services are not included in the Software license
unless expressly stated in a separate offer.

6. SELF-HOSTING, DATA, AND OFFLINE USE

The Software is designed to run on infrastructure controlled by the
Customer. The Licensor does not acquire ownership of the Customer's
